			description: ["A Town with a Legend can raise a Wonder, and a City two. On the hall's Wonders tab, 32 emeralds buy a Wonder Plan, a rolled blueprint with a gold seal.", "", "Each Wonder goes up in four stages, each asking for rare finds from exploring and a workshop's best goods. The side quests say what each Wonder needs."],
